  "$comment": "Layout of 'Daily Efficiency Report Format 20.11.2026.xlsx' as data: ONE ROW PER HOUR of each worksheet (rowField = HOURLY_UNITS). Columns 1..12 are the 12 handwritten cells of that hour; Efficiency = units / standard rate per hour (=V/W in the Excel). Imported by the DbMigrator when missing; afterwards edit it in Admin > Report columns and rebuild.",
